sentences.text:
9. Let the applicant- Siyaram Agrahari be released on bail in Case Crime No. 99 of 2021, under Sections 406 & 420 IPC, Police Station Unchahar, District Raebareli on furnishing a personal bond and two sureties each in the like amount to the satisfaction of magistrate/court concerned, subject to following conditions:-
(i) the applicant shall not tamper with the prosecution evidence;
(ii) the applicant shall not pressurize the prosecution witnesses;
(iii) the applicant shall appear on each and every date fixed by the trial court.
10.

